        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1984-05-15/pdf/FR-1984-05-15.pdf"
      },
      "text": "Section 1. Sections 1(b), 2(b) and 2(d) are amended by deleting, the phrase  \n“Advisory Group on United States-Japan Relations” in each Section and  \ninserting instead the phrase “United States-Japan Advisory Commission.”  \nSection 2(b) is further amended by deleting the phrase “This group” and  \ninserting instead the phrase “This bi-national group.”"
    },
    {
