        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1984-05-15/pdf/FR-1984-05-15.pdf"
      },
      "text": "Sec. 3. Section 4(b) shall read: “In accordance with the Federal Advisory  \nCommittee Act, as amended, the Commission shall terminate on October 31,  \n1984, unless sooner extended.”"
